+| kernel | median | paired wins |
+|---|---|---|
+| k_matchlen | **-44.21%** | 101/101 |
+| k_memchr | **-32.78%** | 100/101 |
+| k_adler32 | -32.37% | 72/101 |
+| k_namechars | -8.29% | 71/101 |
+| k_adler32_do8 | -4.28% | 92/101 |
+| k_classify | -3.37% | 83/101 |
